"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025, January to February sat at 23% of normal on the middle of the grids, while June to July came in at 144%. So far in 2026, May to June stands at 68% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 29848 had its driest year in 1976 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
